But you will presumably also say that the definition of {cinfo} also specif=
ied criteria for distinguishing between two stages of the same lion and sta=
ges of two different lions, and that the distinction cannot be left lingust=
ically unencoded.

 > OK. So in John's lion-hunting context, after his having shot the left
 > lion, you'd say "lo pa cinfo noi zu'a se cmene zo samantas.uu cu zu'a
 > morsi gi'e ku'i ri'u pu'o zi gunta .ii mi'o"?
 >
